            {
                "comment": "Katie is a great teacher!! Very friendly and helpful!!! She also speaks Spanish very clearly!",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Katie is very helpful and passionate about teaching. Her class is interactive, and she teaches the material in a clear and concise manner. Bonus: there's no midterms or final exams for 226.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Amazing!!! 226 is fairly easy, but don't underestimate it. I under studied for every quiz and could have done a lot better in the class. But Katie is absolutely amazing. Speaks Spanish so clearly and literally could not be nicer. Made us cookies once! Corrected one of my essays during office hours and I got an A on that essay. So helpful.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Katie is an amazing Profe! She explains everything clearly and gives excellent tips before the tests! :) She is super nice and always looking to help her students!! She barely assigns homework and if she does, only collects a couple assignments per week, not time consuming. The tests are easy and only need one, maybe two, nights of studying!",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Katie was a nice Spanish instructor who clearly has a passion for teaching the language.  She grades essays fairly, but the 226 quizzes are difficult and frequent.  She's very nice and willing to work with students, provided you don't come to class late or text during class.  Difficult course, but good teacher",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "Very nice teacher, and very easy to understand her spoken spanish. The class isn't hard, but even with what seems like a perfect paper it will come back all marked up in red ink. Luckily you get mult. drafts and can do well enough to easily pull out a B.  Watch out, quizzes can be tricky!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
